0105]},{"nodeId":715050105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2916197090,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、スパイクを起動して、地脈にある黒泥が湧き出る部分を封鎖するんだ…必ずやり遂げてくれよ。","nextNodeIds":[715050106]},{"nodeId":715050106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3325392898,"text":"元々はヘディーヴからの頼みで助けに来ただけだった。あの時、私はこう思ったんだ——もし、この問題を解決できなかったら、スパイクを持ってスメールに帰ればいいだけだって。","nextNodeIds":[715050107]},{"nodeId":715050107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3013789786,"text":"何しろ、「プルシナスパイク」に関する実験は数多く行ってきた。詳細なデータを記載したレポートを書き上げるのも簡単な話だ。","nextNodeIds":[715050108]},{"nodeId":715050108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2152349410,"text":"けど図と昊、それにここで生活している人たちは…一生、この危険な黒泥と共に生きていくことになるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[715050109]},{"nodeId":715050109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3195420714,"text":"もし、私の研究が彼らの役に立たないのなら…ただレポートを一枚書き上げるだけだとしたら、これはあまりに無意味だ。","nextNodeIds":[715050110]},{"nodeId":715050110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":390086938,"text":"だから、私は何としても地脈から湧き出る黒泥を解決すると決めた。それに、この黒泥に触れたことで…スメール学者の私にとってある意味、警醒となった…","nextNodeIds":[715050111]},{"nodeId":715050111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":289122426,"text":"#君の実力は信じているが、黒泥が湧き出てくるところはとても危険だ。くれぐれも気を付けてほしい、{NICKNAME}…","nextNodeIds":[715050112,715050113]},{"nodeId":715050112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":784252378,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[715050114]},{"nodeId":715050114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":336439538,"text":"ハハハ…ゴホッ、ゴホッ…ゴホッ…","nextNodeIds":[715050115]},{"nodeId":715050115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":4174040202,"text":"#君のことを言っているんだ、{NICKNAME}。噴出口で「プルシナスパイク」を起動すれば、黒泥による魔物への影響を小さくすることができる。","nextNodeIds":[715050116]},{"nodeId":715050116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":296341754,"text":"でも、あの黒泥に引き寄せられた魔物はあまりに多い…","nextNodeIds":[715050117]},{"nodeId":715050117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30181,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":608469514,"text":"だから、身の安全を最優先に。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":715050113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":864821722,"text":"スパイクが壊れないよう気を付けるよ…","nextNodeIds":[715050114]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7150501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["166001693","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30181"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":6,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7150502,"order":3,"stepDescription":"「プルシナスパイク」を起動し、地脈の噴出口を塞ぐ","stepDescTextMapHash":69053188,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q71505"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["Q7150502_guide","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":6,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLM